sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as Agente IA (Cliente MCP)
    participant Molu as molu (Front MCP)
    participant MW as Middleware Telemetry
    participant Logger as Logger (4 dominios)
    participant Metrics as Metrics (Prometheus)
    participant Health as Health Check
    participant Xolu as xolu Sustrato

    Note over Agent, Xolu: === INICIO PETICIÓN MCP ===

    Agent->>Molu: HTTP POST /mcp<br/>{method: "tools/call", params: {name: "walk", ...}}
    Molu->>MW: Intercepta request
    MW->>MW: Genera request_id (ULID v2)
    MW->>MW: Extrae trace_id (W3C traceparent) o genera nuevo
    MW->>MW: Parsea method/tool del body JSON
    MW->>MW: Setea headers respuesta: X-Request-ID, X-Trace-ID
    MW->>Logger: logger.WithContext(ctx) con request_id, trace_id, span_id, method, tool
    MW->>Molu: Continúa con contexto enriquecido

    Note over Molu, Logger: === LOGGING DOMINIO APLICACIÓN ===
    Molu->>Logger: logger.Application().Info().Msg("mcp request received")
    Logger->>Logger: Escribe JSON a application.log<br/>{domain: "application", request_id, trace_id, method: "tools/call", tool: "walk"}

    Note over Molu, Xolu: === INVOCACIÓN XOLU ===
    Molu->>Xolu: HTTP POST /walk (con headers X-Request-ID, X-Trace-ID)
    Xolu-->>Molu: 200 OK {output: {...}}
    Molu->>Logger: logger.Application().Info().Msg("mcp request completed")
    Logger->>Logger: Escribe application.log con latency_ms, code=OK

    Note over Molu, Metrics: === MÉTRICAS ===
    Molu->>Metrics: IncRequests(component="xolu-client", method="walk", tool="walk", code="OK")
    Molu->>Metrics: ObserveLatency(component="xolu-client", method="walk", latency_ms)
    Metrics->>Metrics: Incrementa molu_requests_total, molu_latency_seconds

    Note over Molu, Health: === HEALTH CHECK PERIÓDICO ===
    Health->>Xolu: Ping periódico (cada 10s)
    Xolu-->>Health: 200 OK
    Health->>Health: SetXoluStatus(true, now)
    Health->>Health: Cache 30s

    Note over Agent, Molu: === RESPUESTA ===
    Molu-->>Agent: HTTP 200 OK<br/>{result: {...}}<br/>Headers: X-Request-ID, X-Trace-ID

    Note over Logger: === ARCHIVOS DE LOG ===
    Logger->>system.log: Arranque, apagado, config
    Logger->>application.log: Tool calls, validaciones
    Logger->>network.log: xolu ping/calls, latencia, códigos
    Logger->>security.log: Auth decisions (flush síncrono)

    Note over Metrics, Health: === ENDPOINTS TELEMETRÍA (puerto 9090) ===
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: GET /metrics → molu_requests_total, molu_latency_seconds, molu_errors_total
    Health-->>K8s: GET /healthz → 200 OK (status ok/degraded)

    Note over Agent, Xolu: === FIN PETICIÓN ===